   'rounds_reps',
   'Laura honors FBI Special Agent Laura Schwartzenberger, 43, who was fatally shot on Feb. 2 in Sunrise, Florida, while executing a search warrant in a case of violent crime against children. She joined the FBI in 2005 and was a longtime CrossFit athlete at CrossFit Vice, where she regularly attended the 5 a.m. class.

With a partner, you complete as many rounds as you can in 21 minutes of a 30-calorie row, 20 burpees over the rower and 10 power cleans (155 lb / 105 lb). CrossFit does not say how to split the work, so agree on a plan first. The row and the burpees keep your heart rate high, and the cleans come when you are already out of breath.',
   '[{"name": "Row for Calories", "reps": "30 cal", "tip": "Drive with your legs and keep the pace steady. Short turns keep it high."}, {"name": "Burpees", "reps": "20 over the rower", "tip": "Chest to the floor beside the rower, then jump or step over it. Land on both feet."}, {"name": "Power Cleans", "reps": "10", "tip": "Catch the bar above parallel. Quick singles or short sets.", "rx_men": "155 lb", "rx_women": "105 lb"}]'::jsonb,
   'Score is total rounds + reps for the team.',
