   '["One simple plan is to swap every 10 calories on the row, 5 burpees and 5 cleans.", "Keep the rower damper at a setting you know well, so the calories come steadily.", "On the burpees, land on both feet on the other side and turn quickly for the next rep.", "Set a flat back on each power clean, even when you are breathing hard.", "The resting partner should be ready to start before the working partner finishes."]'::jsonb,
   'Lower the barbell to 115 lb / 75 lb or less. Step over the rower instead of jumping. Cut the row to 20 calories and the burpees to 12.',
   '[{"question": "What is the Laura workout?", "answer": "With a partner, as many rounds as possible in 21 minutes of a 30-calorie row, 20 burpees over the rower and 10 power cleans (155 lb / 105 lb)."}, {"question": "How do partners split Laura?", "answer": "CrossFit does not say. Split the work however you like, and use the same plan each time you repeat the workout so your scores compare."}, {"question": "How many reps are in one round of Laura?", "answer": "30 calories, 20 burpees and 10 power cleans, for 60 reps per round."}, {"question": "Who was Laura?", "answer": "FBI Special Agent Laura Schwartzenberger, 43, a longtime CrossFit athlete at CrossFit Vice. She was fatally shot on Feb. 2 in Sunrise, Florida, while executing a search warrant."}]'::jsonb,
